{"product_id":"gid://shopify/Product/7392872267934","title":"Usahana Pouch (Memories Of Sanrio Heisei Design)","old_description":"\n                               \u003ch3\u003e Details: \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n                               \u003cli\u003e Brand: Sanrio\u003c/li\u003e\n                               \n\n                                \u003cli\u003e Size: 21.0×11.0×7.5cm\u003c/li\u003e\n                               \u003c/ul\u003e\n                   ","new_description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDescription\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe Usahana Pouch Memories Of Sanrio Heisei Design is a charming and practical accessory that combines nostalgia with functionality. This pouch is perfect for organizing your small essentials whether at home, school, or on the go. Featuring a delightful design inspired by Sanrio's beloved characters, it adds a touch of whimsy to your everyday routine.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eCrafted with attention to detail, the Usahana Pouch offers ample space to keep your items secure and easily accessible. Its compact size makes it convenient to carry in your bag or backpack. This versatile pouch is not only a stylish statement but also a useful companion for storing cosmetics, stationery, or other small belongings. Enjoy the blend of cute design and practical use with this special Sanrio product.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDetails\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Product Material:\u003c/strong\u003e Fabric\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Manufacturer:\u003c/strong\u003e Sanrio\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003eAdorable Usahana character design from Sanrio's Heisei era collection\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eCompact size measuring 21.0×11.0×7.5 cm ideal for organizing small items\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eLightweight and portable for easy carrying in bags or backpacks\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eDurable fabric construction ensuring long-lasting use\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eHow to use\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eUse the Usahana Pouch to neatly store and organize your small essentials such as cosmetics, stationery, or personal items. Simply place your items inside and zip it closed to keep them secure. Carry it inside your larger bag or use it as a standalone accessory when running errands or traveling.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eCare instructions\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eTo keep your Usahana Pouch clean, gently wipe the exterior with a damp cloth and mild soap if needed. Avoid soaking or machine washing to maintain the fabric and design quality. Store the pouch in a dry place away from direct sunlight to prevent fading or damage.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e","category":"general","has_sufficient_data":true,"status":"success","error_message":null,"processed_at":"2026-03-08T13